{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Trad&amp;Simp Chinese Conversion》是一款在 iPhone 與 iPad 上轉換中文電子書的工具，可處理橫排與直排格式、字形及標點符號，適合經常閱讀或整理中文電子書的讀者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線轉換電子書排版</h2>\n<p>App 可轉換 iPhone 或 iPad 上的中文電子書，支援直排與橫排互換、字形轉換及標點符號調整，並對應中港台用語習慣。使用時只需選擇 EPUB 或純文字檔，程式會另存新檔，原始檔保持不變。轉換過程完全離線，字典內建於 App，無需網絡，亦不會上傳任何內容。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-733-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-734-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-735-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-736-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-737-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-738-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Trad&amp;Simp Chinese Conversion</li>\n<li>應用類別：Book</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T13:59:12.796383+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}